545
00:20:39,424 --> 00:20:41,672
race, a Monaco hero who won in

546
00:20:41,672 --> 00:20:42,346
Bugattis.

547
00:20:42,526 --> 00:20:45,103
Every modern Bugatti is a reminder of

548
00:20:45,103 --> 00:20:46,775
